{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>2025年港姐冠軍陳詠詩卸任後尺度大解放，日前在社交平台驚喜派發惹火福利圖。相中的她換上極度性感的純白造型，更附上一句極具挑逗性的霸氣發文。</p>\n<h2>冠軍陳詠詩化身惹火天使震撼眼球</h2>\n<p>這組極具視覺衝擊的美照中，陳詠詩頭戴精緻天使光環並配上小巧白色羽毛翅膀，展現出清純與調皮交織的獨特氣質。最令網民瘋狂之處在於她穿上一件超貼身純白喱士吊帶馬甲，配合低胸剪裁以及胸前黑色蝴蝶結與交叉綁帶設計，將其傲人豐滿上圍展露無遺。加上眼角點綴閃亮裝飾及甜美笑容，身上僅配戴簡約項鏈與細緻手鏈，讓大眾視覺焦點完全集中在其白皙肌膚與魔鬼身材之中。</p>\n<h2>霸氣配文要求聽命展現破格豪放作風</h2>\n<p>面對這輯尺度爆燈的寫真，陳詠詩親自為這場視覺盛宴定下極具挑釁性的基調。她在發佈相片時毫不掩飾自己的強勢氣場，直接配文寫道「乖乖跪低聽命」，將照片中純潔天使形象與言語間魔鬼般的霸道結合。這句簡短卻極具張力的宣言打破大眾對香港小姐傳統端莊形象的既定印象，將其大膽作風展現出來，引起外界對這位冠軍級人馬破格言論的強烈關注。</p>\n<h2>頂級學霸陳詠詩家世顯赫兼名花有主</h2>\n<p>翻查資料，身為前香港藝術體操代表隊成員具有極強學霸背景，先後在加州大學柏克萊分校及哥倫比亞大學取得學士與科技管理碩士學位，目前正於倫敦大學學院遙距攻讀教育博士，更曾於科技巨頭亞馬遜工作兩年。其家境同樣極為顯赫，曾祖父為米業大亨陳瑞祺，母親則是香港芭蕾舞學校創辦人。感情方面她早已名花有主，與在南加州大學結識的男友Martin自2023年拍拖至今，兩人目前感情維持穩定。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚性感造型直呼願意乖乖跪低</h2>\n<p>惹火美照連同霸氣宣言一出，隨即在各大社交平台引爆洗版式討論。大批網民對這次罕有大解放感到驚喜，紛紛湧入留言區激讚她「簡直是人間天使」，亦有人直指其「身材好到犯規」。針對其充滿挑逗意味的配文，網民反應同樣熱烈，不少人笑言看到這種天使與魔鬼結合的極致誘惑後，真的願意「乖乖跪低」配合其要求。大量網絡留言均聚焦討論其性感身段與今次的大膽發文。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377767809718604_10916733506aeae00ed64c7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"staceydevinachan_1793618673_4021484803986428461_6887586.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377767809718604_10916733506aeae00ed64c7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@staceydevinachan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377768190472926_21106528526aeae012be8e5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"staceydevinachan_1793618673_4021484800966554050_6887586.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377768190472926_21106528526aeae012be8e5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@staceydevinachan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377768793728789_7113556896aeae018329d0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"staceydevinachan_1793618673_4021484797636333021_6887586.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377768793728789_7113556896aeae018329d0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@staceydevinachan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/photo_6170128010477422755_y_113123006968b4622737c62-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳詠詩 港姐冠軍 陳詠詩由初選至今一個被視為大熱，如今眾望所歸大熱封冠！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/photo_6170128010477422755_y_113123006968b4622737c62-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳詠詩由初選至今一個被視為大熱，如今眾望所歸大熱封冠！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178064866424447457_17065960156a228adcaaa14.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"staceydevinachan_1780563762_3911974748954794489_6887586.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178064866424447457_17065960156a228adcaaa14.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@staceydevinachan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178064867661484608_3039136916a228ae5a2d0b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"staceydevinachan_1774610616_3862034437710543457_6887586 (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178064867661484608_3039136916a228ae5a2d0b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@staceydevinachan）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178064864962343078_3818381846a228ac9eaea4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"staceydevinachan_1757071615_3714908423965644804_6887586.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178064864962343078_3818381846a228ac9eaea4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@staceydevinachan）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:45:45.327385+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1236,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:34:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:57.206093+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:38:49.601241+00:00","content_hash":"bce152c11380d4b57e6381d61e5699114aa3cf799bb8778f05ec85edf2f9f551","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}